question:
设 A 是 $m \times n$ 阶矩阵，B 是 $n \times m$ 阶矩阵， $m \geqslant n$ .

(1) 证明 $|\lambda I_m - AB| = \lambda^{m-n} |\lambda I_n - BA|$ ( $I_m, I_n$ 分别是 $m$ 与 $n$ 阶单位矩阵);

(2) 计算 $D_{n} = \left| \begin{array}{cccc} a_{1}b_{1} & 1 + a_{1}b_{2} & \cdots & 1 + a_{1}b_{n} \\ 1 + a_{2}b_{1} & a_{2}b_{2} & \cdots & 1 + a_{2}b_{n} \\ \vdots & \vdots & & \vdots \\ 1 + a_{n}b_{1} & 1 + a_{n}b_{2} & \cdots & a_{n}b_{n} \end{array} \right|$ .
